<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="uk">
  <file id="dialogs\support\cv15_bill.txt" original="dialogs\support\cv15_bill.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Excuse me, $(#mister/ma'am), but I'm really busy right now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Вибачте, $(#містер/пані), але я зараз дуже зайнятий.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ehey! What's up, $(context.player.Name)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ей! Як справи, $(context.player.Name)?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I hope the truce is for real. I don't want to suddenly see a rat army tramplin' my mushrooms.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Сподіваюся, перемир'я справжнє. Я не хочу раптом побачити армію щурів, що топче мої гриби.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Dead burrowers are best burrowers. ::Laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мертві копачі – найкращі копачі. ::Сміється.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Take care not to step on the mushrooms.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Стежте, щоб не наступити на гриби.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No time to talk now... work beckons.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Немає часу на розмови зараз... робота кличе.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Rathound King for Edgar? That's not a good trade, damn it!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Король ратогаундів за Едгара? Це погана угода, клянуся!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I am a busy man.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я зайнята людина.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>These mushrooms won't pick themselves, you know.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ці гриби самі себе не зберуть, знаєте.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Whistles an unfamiliar tune.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Свистить незнайому мелодію.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It is a bit quieter around here, dontcha think?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тут трохи тихіше, чи не так?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Rathound King's a goner! Now back to my mushrooms.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Король ратогаундів пішов! Тепер повертаюся до своїх грибів.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Sighs.::  I got so much work to do...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Зітхає.:: У мене так багато роботи...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Pickin' mushrooms is serious work. Just 'cause I'm not out huntin' doesn't make my job any less important.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Збір грибів – серйозна робота. Просто тому, що я не полюю, не означає, що моя робота менш важлива.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
</xliff>